OL,3,GNEWSABoom in 'massively misunderstood'
OL,4,Asumo wrestling
OL,5,
OL,6,FSumo wrestling clubs have been opening
OL,7,Fat pace across the UK as social media
OL,8,Fhas helped to change perceptions of the
OL,9,F"massively misunderstood" sport.
OL,11,FJoe Andrews, the founder of the
OL,12,Fsouth-west of England's first sumo
OL,13,Fclub, believes people had previously
OL,14,Fbeen put off due to incorrect notions
OL,15,Fthat they have to be a heavy weight to
OL,16,Fcompete.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
