OL,3,GNEWSABoom in 'massively misunderstood'
OL,4,Asumo wrestling
OL,5,
OL,6,F"People think that's what sumo is - and
OL,7,Fthat's professional sumo, but we're
OL,8,Fdoing amateur sumo and it's far more
OL,9,Finclusive - it's massively
OL,10,Fmisunderstood," said Andrews, whose
OL,11,Fclub is based in Glastonbury.
OL,13,FIn two years, the number of clubs based
OL,14,Fin England has grown from one to 13,
OL,15,Fwhich Andrews said is largely down to
OL,16,Fviral social media videos.
